{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在上半屏第一段的大号白色文字及紫色强调词“忘了藏好喜欢”，随后视线容易被中部第二段同样醒目的紫色词“心里空落落的”吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他这次没藏住喜欢，被对方看出了有多在乎。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"空落落、担心被嫌太黏。\",\n  \"missed\": \"此前对方始终亲近他的反差，以及这次被看穿后，他感觉亲近像隔了一层的变化；两者之间的心理因果不容易第一眼连起来。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两段大号文字都很显眼，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在两块大字中，需要把被看穿喜欢的处境和空落落、怕被嫌弃的感受拼起来。\",\n    \"单块文字包含前情、当前变化和心理反应，不能只看紫色强调词就完整理解。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1b0689a7-8ad5-49b6-aea5-53f4c3ca222a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T010924365637Z", "elapsed_seconds": 21.156, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:09:45.512872+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3993b06df8adff3c49ebbaa69bff9a3594748ff0f668e2063045da11ff78ce77", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\g